From 820c1c0c1dcb7db3ede1dd83fca405b0569437c0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: OT2 Port <ot2@local>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 12:41:17 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] OT2 playable build: single-core report, uinput gamepad
 ignore, HUD auto-hide, NACP icon, debug instrumentation

---
 app/src/main/AndroidManifest.xml              |   2 +-
 .../main/java/dev/ot2/port/GameInputView.java |   5 +-
 .../main/java/dev/ot2/port/MainActivity.java  |   2 +
