 app/src/main/res/mipmap-mdpi/ic_launcher.png  | Bin 0 -> 3465 bytes
 app/src/main/res/mipmap-xhdpi/ic_launcher.png | Bin 0 -> 5985 bytes
 .../main/res/mipmap-xxhdpi/ic_launcher.png    | Bin 0 -> 9348 bytes
 .../main/res/mipmap-xxxhdpi/ic_launcher.png   | Bin 0 -> 12909 bytes
 native/graphics/backend.cpp                   |   2 +-
 native/graphics/gpu_completion.inc            |   2 +-
 native/guest.cpp                              |  14 +-
 native/probe.cpp                              |   3 +-
